{"id": "70195", "title": "重生之狭路", "author": "樱之雪歌", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 33, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70195.htm", "intro": "如果说人生就像是一场豪赌，那么李弘扬就是一个偏执的赌徒。\r\n    他将事业全部押给了益天集团，将感情全部押给了明唯。\r\n    没想到最后以满盘皆输收场。\r\n    既然老天给了他还魂的机会，仰天大笑三声，哈哈哈，他该如何去讨回这血债呢？\r\n    这其实就是一个绝世好攻被压成受的故事，大囧～\r\n        1、本文旨在和大家分享些故事和感悟，除「借尸还魂」外没有其他金手指，不喜慎入。\r\n    2、阅读即阅世，此文部分题材来自生活，如阅读过程中产生不适请速度点X。\r\n    3、天才不少全才不多，人总有犯二的时候。\r\n    4、尽管我写此文做了大量的功课，但不保证那些专业知识没有漏洞，所以有纰漏的地方请到晋江给我留个言说一下，我会改的。\r\n    以上，谢谢！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70195", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "还魂", "file": "10881725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "相接", "file": "10881726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "现状", "file": "10881727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "入戏", "file": "10881728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "远朋", "file": "10881729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "近亲", "file": "10881730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "故人", "file": "10881731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "浮桥", "file": "10881732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "算计", "file": "10881733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "维谷", "file": "10881734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "是非", "file": "10881735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情糜", "file": "10881736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "蓝夜", "file": "10881737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "落差", "file": "10881738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "傻冒", "file": "10881739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "掠影", "file": "10881740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "大坑", "file": "10881741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "认知", "file": "10881742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "迁怒", "file": "10881743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "浮光", "file": "10881744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "微兆", "file": "10881745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "遇见", "file": "10881746.html", "available": false}, {"tit